Today I am going to an Irani cafe.
This place is very famous in Mumbai.
This cafe is very old.
I walk inside.
There are many people here.
There is a bustle everywhere.
I stand at the entrance.
I look all around the room.
The atmosphere here is vintage.
There are wooden chairs here.
Their color is dark.
There are tables here too.
There are tablecloths on them.
There is a checkered pattern on the cloths.
I look up.
There are large fans above.
Those fans are turning slowly.
Everything is very beautiful.
I like this old cafe very much.
